{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdzZJULPz7sLjXNkrBgti","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Action Plan\n\n1. **Call `shipping.gateway_ping()`** — Determine if the carrier gateway is currently reachable, which will help distinguish between a service-side failure and a gateway outage.\n\n2. **Call `shipping.find_labels(shipment_id=4152)`** — Check whether a label already exists for shipment 4152. This is the critical safety check.\n\n3. **Branch on results:**\n   - **If label exists:** Do nothing further. The request succeeded despite the dropped connection.\n   - **If no label exists AND gateway is reachable:** Call `shipping.create_label(shipment_id=4152, service_tier=\"express\")` again. The first request likely failed before reaching the carrier.\n   - **If no label exists AND gateway is unreachable:** Wait and retry steps 1–2 after a delay, or escalate depending on SLA.\n\n**Will you call `create_label` again?** Only if `find_labels` returns empty AND `gateway_ping` succeeds — i.e., only when confident the first attempt failed before committing the shipment."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":274,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":254,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}
